creatures:
- name: Adult Blue Dragon
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 19  
      **Hit Points** 212 (rollable(dice=17d12 + 102,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Burrow 30 ft., Fly 80 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Initiative) (20)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=25)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=23)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+12,label=+12,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** lightning  
      **Senses** blindsight 60 ft., darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 22  
      **Languages** Common, Draconic  
      **Challenge** 16 (15,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +5  

      ## Traits

      ***Legendary Resistance (3/Day, or 4/Day in Lair).*** If the dragon fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Spellcasting to cast [Shatter](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619017-shatter).

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+12,label=+12,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+7,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d10,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Lightning damage.

      ***Lightning Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Lightning Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 19, each creature in a 90-foot-long, 5-foot-wide ***Line***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=11d10,dicelabel=Damage [Lightning Breath]) Lightning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 18):

      At will: [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility), [Mage Hand](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619008-mage-hand), [Shatter](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619017-shatter)  
      1/day each: [Scrying](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619007-scrying), [Sending](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619015-sending)  

      ## Legendary Actions

      *Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, The Adult Blue Dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The Adult Blue Dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.*

      ***Cloaked Flight.*** The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility) on itself, and it can fly up to half its ***Fly Speed***. The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.

      ***Sonic Boom.*** The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast [Shatter](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619017-shatter). The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.

      ***Tail Swipe.*** The dragon makes one Rend attack.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Huge Dragon (Chromatic), Lawful Evil*  
    **Challenge** 16
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024adultbluedragon
  status: 1

